flf2a$ 9 9 14 -1 6 0 0 0
Cosmeron Bold -- orbital geometric FIGfont, 2026.
Heavy box-drawing strokes, reinforced diagonals, and rounded orbital corners.
O = ring with filled core; 0 = power-bar circle (COSMER0N for wordmark).
Full-width 12 columns, height 9, 95 printable ASCII glyphs and seven extended slots.
UTF-8 artwork; use Cosmeron-Bold-ASCII.flf for older FIGlet terminals.
License: EUPL-1.2-or-later, original Cosmeron design.
